; No zarith, and none may be added: Cardano is Ed25519-only, so the signing
; closure needs no bignum and therefore no GMP -- which is what keeps a Solo5
; duniverse small. Blake2b-224/256 come straight from digestif's functor, so
; not even mirage-crypto-blockchain is needed at this layer.
(library
 (name cardano_types)
 (public_name cardano-types)
 (libraries web3-codec-cbor digestif))
